  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cambodia Takeo Province: Increasing Farmer Income and Responding to Climate Change through Regenerative Agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment and operation of pilot farms for regenerative crops to verify soil resilience, crop productivity, and economic feasibility of cultivation.  Creation of regenerative agriculture cultivation manual.  Stengslakou Cooperative Farmer Regenerative Agriculture Vegetable Growing Technology Training, GAP Certification Training, Marketing Training.  Branding of locally produced GAP-certified agricultural products and discovery of agricultural products suppliers.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project provides regenerative agriculture technology training to farmers in Takeo Province, Cambodia, to reduce production costs, increase productivity and farm income, and ensure a sustainable approach even in the face of climate change economically and ecologically.Steng Slakou &#xD611;&#xB3D9;&#xC870;&#xD569; &#xB18D;&#xAC00;&#xC758; &#xC7AC;&#xC0DD;&#xB18D;&#xC5C5;&#xC744; &#xD1B5;&#xD55C; &#xCC44;&#xC18C; &#xC7AC;&#xBC30;&#xB85C; &#xC18C;&#xB4DD; &#xAE30;&#xBC18; &#xB9C8;&#xB828;</narrative>
  </description>
